sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as odh-dashboard<br/>(BFF + kube-rbac-proxy)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>(Admission Webhooks)
    participant KServe as KServe Manager
    participant ODHModelCtrl as odh-model-controller
    participant GW as data-science-gateway<br/>(Envoy)
    participant ModelPod as Model Server Pod
    participant Client as External Client

    Note over User,Client: Workflow 1: Model Deployment via Dashboard

    User->>Dashboard: Create InferenceService via UI
    Dashboard->>Dashboard: BFF sidecar validates via<br/>SubjectAccessReview
    Dashboard->>K8sAPI: Submit InferenceService CR
    K8sAPI->>K8sAPI: Admission webhooks:<br/>kserve validates/defaults core CRD<br/>odh-model-controller adds platform mutations
    K8sAPI-->>KServe: InferenceService watch triggers
    KServe->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment, Service,<br/>HTTPRoute, HPA/KEDA ScaledObject
    K8sAPI-->>ODHModelCtrl: InferenceService watch triggers
    ODHModelCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy,<br/>ServiceMonitor, PodMonitor,<br/>Route, Kuadrant AuthPolicy
    Note over KServe: Pod starts, pulls image<br/>from registry.redhat.io
    KServe->>ModelPod: Model server starts<br/>(vLLM, OpenVINO, etc.)
    ModelPod->>ModelPod: Downloads model from S3
    KServe->>GW: HTTPRoute attaches to<br/>data-science-gateway

    Note over Client,GW: Production Inference
    Client->>GW: POST /v1/models/my-model:predict<br/>(HTTPS/443)
    GW->>ModelPod: Forward via HTTPRoute<br/>(auth per gateway policy)
    ModelPod-->>GW: Prediction response
    GW-->>Client: JSON response (HTTPS)

    User->>Dashboard: View model metrics
    Dashboard->>K8sAPI: Query InferenceService status
    K8sAPI-->>Dashboard: Model status + metrics
    Dashboard-->>User: Show model dashboard

