sequenceDiagram
    participant ExtClient as External Client
    participant MaaSGW as maas-default-gateway<br/>(Envoy)
    participant Kuadrant as Kuadrant / Authorino<br/>(AuthPolicy)
    participant MaaSAPI as maas-api<br/>(Port 8443)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant MaaSCtrl as maas-controller
    participant KServe2 as KServe<br/>(LLMInferenceService)
    participant DSGW as data-science-gateway

    Note over ExtClient,DSGW: Workflow 2: Models-as-a-Service API Request

    ExtClient->>MaaSGW: Request with API key<br/>(Bearer sk-oai-*)<br/>HTTPS/443
    MaaSGW->>Kuadrant: AuthPolicy evaluation

    Note over Kuadrant: 3 authentication methods:<br/>1. API key callback<br/>2. K8s TokenReview<br/>3. Optional OIDC JWT

    Kuadrant->>MaaSAPI: API key validation callback<br/>POST /internal/v1/api-keys/validate
    MaaSAPI-->>Kuadrant: Key valid + subscription info

    Note over Kuadrant: OPA Rego authorization:<br/>subscription/group/binding check

    Kuadrant-->>MaaSGW: Authorized
    MaaSGW->>MaaSAPI: Forward request<br/>(authenticated context)

    alt Model listing
        MaaSAPI->>PG: Query available models<br/>for subscription
        PG-->>MaaSAPI: Model list
        MaaSAPI-->>MaaSGW: /v1/models response
    else Subscription management
        MaaSAPI->>PG: Create/update subscription
        PG-->>MaaSAPI: Subscription state
        MaaSAPI-->>MaaSGW: Subscription response
    else API key lifecycle
        MaaSAPI->>PG: Create/rotate/revoke API key
        PG-->>MaaSAPI: Key state
        MaaSAPI-->>MaaSGW: API key response
    end

    MaaSGW-->>ExtClient: JSON response (HTTPS)

    Note over MaaSCtrl,DSGW: Background: Model Route Management
    MaaSCtrl->>KServe2: Watch LLMInferenceService<br/>for model availability
    KServe2-->>MaaSCtrl: Model available event
    MaaSCtrl->>DSGW: Create HTTPRoute for<br/>model endpoint

