sequenceDiagram
    participant User3 as User / Dashboard
    participant K8sAPI3 as Kubernetes API
    participant LLMISVC as kserve llmisvc controller
    participant K8s3 as Kubernetes
    participant EPP as llm-d-router (EPP)<br/>Endpoint Picker Plugin
    participant Prefill as llm-d Prefill Pods
    participant Decode as llm-d Decode Pods
    participant KVCache as llm-d-kv-cache<br/>ModelExpress gRPC
    participant WVA as workload-variant-autoscaler
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over User3,Prom: Workflow 5: LLM Disaggregated Inference (llm-d)

    User3->>K8sAPI3: Create LLMInferenceService CR
    K8sAPI3-->>LLMISVC: LLMInferenceService watch triggers

    Note over LLMISVC: Reconciles 13 resource types:<br/>Deployments, InferencePool,<br/>Gateway, HPA, KEDA, LWS

    LLMISVC->>K8s3: Create Prefill Deployment<br/>(separate scaling group)
    LLMISVC->>K8s3: Create Decode Deployment<br/>(separate scaling group)
    LLMISVC->>K8s3: Create InferencePool<br/>(Gateway API Inference Extension)
    LLMISVC->>K8s3: Create Gateway resources<br/>+ DestinationRule (Istio)

    Prefill->>Prefill: Start vLLM server<br/>Download model from S3
    Decode->>Decode: Start vLLM server<br/>Download model from S3

    Note over EPP,Decode: Runtime: Inference Request Flow

    EPP->>EPP: Select backend pod via<br/>InferencePool (model-aware routing)
    EPP->>Prefill: Route prefill request<br/>(Envoy sidecar)
    Prefill->>KVCache: Store KV cache<br/>(ModelExpress gRPC, mTLS STRICT)
    Prefill-->>EPP: Prefill complete

    EPP->>Decode: Route decode request<br/>(Envoy sidecar)
    Decode->>KVCache: Retrieve KV cache<br/>(ModelExpress gRPC, mTLS STRICT)
    Decode-->>EPP: Token stream

    Note over WVA,Prom: Autoscaling Loop

    WVA->>Prom: Query InferencePool metrics
    Prom-->>WVA: Request rate, queue depth,<br/>latency percentiles
    WVA->>K8s3: Scale prefill/decode replicas<br/>via KEDA ScaledObjects

