sequenceDiagram
    participant User4 as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard4 as odh-dashboard
    participant K8sAPI4 as Kubernetes API
    participant WBOp as workbenches-operator
    participant KF as kubeflow notebook-controller
    participant NB as Notebook Pod<br/>(StatefulSet)
    participant RhodsOp4 as rhods-operator<br/>Gateway Controller
    participant Router as OpenShift Router

    Note over User4,Router: Workflow 3: Notebook Workspace Creation

    User4->>Dashboard4: Create notebook via UI<br/>(select image, resources, connections)
    Dashboard4->>K8sAPI4: Submit Notebook CR

    K8sAPI4->>WBOp: Mutating webhook fires
    Note over WBOp: Injects HardwareProfile<br/>resources and data-connection<br/>secrets into pod template
    WBOp-->>K8sAPI4: Mutated Notebook CR

    K8sAPI4-->>KF: Notebook watch triggers
    KF->>K8sAPI4: Create StatefulSet,<br/>Service, PodDisruptionBudget

    NB->>NB: Pod starts<br/>Jupyter server initializes
    NB->>NB: Mounts data-connection<br/>secrets for S3 access

    RhodsOp4->>Router: Create Route for notebook<br/>via kube-auth-proxy OIDC

    User4->>Router: Access notebook URL<br/>(HTTPS/443)
    Router->>NB: Route to notebook pod<br/>(kube-auth-proxy authenticated)
    NB-->>User4: Jupyter interface

