sequenceDiagram
    participant User5 as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard5 as odh-dashboard
    participant DSPOp as data-science-pipelines-operator
    participant DSPAPI as DSP API Server
    participant ArgoCtrl as argo-workflows
    participant StepPod as Pipeline Step Pod
    participant S3 as Object Storage (S3)
    participant SWCtrl as Scheduled Workflow Controller

    Note over User5,SWCtrl: Workflow 4: Pipeline Execution

    User5->>Dashboard5: Submit pipeline run<br/>(select pipeline, parameters)
    Dashboard5->>DSPAPI: Create pipeline run

    Note over DSPOp: Manages DSPA resources:<br/>API server, persistence agent,<br/>scheduled workflow controller

    DSPAPI->>ArgoCtrl: Create Argo Workflow

    loop For each pipeline step
        ArgoCtrl->>StepPod: Execute step as pod
        StepPod->>S3: Read input artifacts
        StepPod->>StepPod: Execute step logic<br/>(training, preprocessing, etc.)
        StepPod->>S3: Write output artifacts<br/>(SeaweedFS or S3)
        StepPod-->>ArgoCtrl: Step complete
    end

    ArgoCtrl-->>DSPAPI: Workflow complete
    DSPAPI-->>Dashboard5: Pipeline run status
    Dashboard5-->>User5: Show results

    Note over SWCtrl: Recurring runs managed by<br/>scheduled workflow controller
    SWCtrl->>DSPAPI: Trigger scheduled run<br/>(cron-based)
